<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Facebook's role in the disinformation ecosystem remains rooted in long-form narratives and older user demographics. Our network analysis showed tight clusters formed around hashtags such as #PNTCD, #AurelianPavelescu, #alegeriprezidentiale, and #statulroman. The thematic overlap was substantial, but the communicative style differed markedly.)
/E (Facebook's role in the disinformation ecosystem remains rooted in long-form narratives and older user demographics. Our network analysis showed tight clusters formed around hashtags such as #PNTCD, #AurelianPavelescu, #alegeriprezidentiale, and #statulroman. The thematic overlap was substantial, but the communicative style differed markedly.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
