/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (TikTok played a distinctive role in spreading disinformation by merging political content with audiovisual trends. The platform's native mechanics, short videos, remixing tools, algorithmic feeds, enabled users to encode political messages into entertainment formats, making them more palatable and shareable. )
