194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (A particularly viral account, @3d_dog_danutz, used recurring audio loops and visual montages to generate tens of thousands of views. This user repeatedly framed Romania's electoral scene as corrupt, externally controlled, and in need of radical change. Unlike X, where ideological clarity prevails, TikTok thrives on emotional ambiguity, irony, and aesthetic coding, making fact-checking more complex.)
/E (A particularly viral account, @3d_dog_danutz, used recurring audio loops and visual montages to generate tens of thousands of views. This user repeatedly framed Romania's electoral scene as corrupt, externally controlled, and in need of radical change. Unlike X, where ideological clarity prevails, TikTok thrives on emotional ambiguity, irony, and aesthetic coding, making fact-checking more complex.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
